  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "fixation-with-selection",
  "title": {
    "en": "Fixation with selection in the draw",
    "zh": "抽取中有选择时的固定"
  },
  "kind": "theorem",
  "status": "recorded-checked",
  "family": "F01",
  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-22T14:52:46+00:00",
  "statement": {
    "en": "With replacement one at a time, up with weight a and down with b, the fixation share tends to a potential's ratio: the starting share where a = b, above it from every mixed start where b < a, and the favoured kind lost with weight at least b^i.",
    "zh": "一次替换一个、上升权重 a、下降 b 时，固定份额趋于势之比：a = b 时为起始份额，b < a 时自每个混合起点高于它，受青睐的一类以至少 b^i 的权重失去。"
  },
  "laws": [
    {
      "en": "Replacement one at a time among M + 1: from a mixed population the count goes up with weight a and down with b, a population of one kind staying; the histories are counted step by step and compose.",
      "zh": "M + 1 个成员中一次替换一个：混合种群中计数以权重 a 上升、以 b 下降，单一类的种群保持；历史逐步计数并可复合。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.Mixed",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_mixed",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_one_kind",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_stays",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_add",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_mul",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_le",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_const",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_comp",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_congr"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "The potential with steps b^j a^(M - j) is harmonic for the steps, a times a step being b times the one below, so it keeps its weighted value over any number of steps.",
      "zh": "步长为 b^j a^(M - j) 的势对这些步是调和的（a 乘一步等于 b 乘其下一步），故在任意步数中保持其加权值。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.rise",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.rise_step",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_harmonic",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_potential",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_le_succ",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_mono",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_beyond",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_le_top"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "The histories fixing the first kind weigh, times the potential at the top, at most the whole weight times the potential at the start, and with the varied ones at least it; the varied ones vanish geometrically, so the fixation share tends to the potential's ratio.",
      "zh": "固定第一类的历史乘顶端之势，至多为总权重乘起点之势，加上仍有差异者则至少为它；仍有差异者几何地消失，故固定份额趋于势之比。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.fixed",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.lost",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.varied",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.partition",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.value_partition",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.fixed_below",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_within",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.fixation_bounds",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.climbs",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.varied_step",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.varied_vanishes",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.fixation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "With a = b the share is the starting share; with b <= a at least it; with b < a strictly above it from every mixed start; and the favoured kind is lost with weight at least b^i.",
      "zh": "a = b 时份额即起始份额；b <= a 时至少为它；b < a 时自每个混合起点严格高于它；受青睐的一类以至少 b^i 的权重失去。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.rise_neutral",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_neutral",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.neutral_share",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.rise_antitone",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.rise_antitone_le",
