        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.potential_from",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.favoured_share",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.favoured_share_above",
        "Becoming.Drift.Replacement.lost_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Witness: two members, up two and down one, the first kind fixing with share two of three.",
      "zh": "见证：两个成员，上升二、下降一，第一类以三分之二的份额固定。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Drift.Favoured.two_members"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "en": "No axiom. Two kinds; replacement one at a time with constant natural-number weights a and b; only the steps that change the count read; no mutation.",
      "zh": "不加公理。两类；以恒定自然数权重 a 与 b 一次替换一个；只读改变计数的步；无突变。"
    }
  ],
  "does_not_show": [
    {
      "en": "Selection in sampled generations (Wright-Fisher with selection), where the fixation share has no closed count.",
      "zh": "多代抽样中的选择（有选择的 Wright-Fisher），其固定份额没有封闭的计数。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That the common factor of the one-birth-one-death chain drops is read, with no fuller chain stated.",
      "zh": "一生一死链的公因子可约去是读法，未陈述更完整的链。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "Which history happens: the counts weigh histories; ranking goes through the comparison C.",
      "zh": "哪一历史发生：计数只称量历史；排序经由比较 C。",
      "kind": "non-implication"
    }
  ],
  "counterexamples": [
